          &quot;acceptedAnswer&quot;: {
            &quot;text&quot;: &quot;Somewhere between ₹4 LPA and ₹8 LPA to start, moving toward the broader market average of ₹8.8–9.7 LPA within a year or two.&quot;,
            &quot;@type&quot;: &quot;Answer&quot;
